| 18a | AFTER | `C16` a clock decides a document's arrival: the island's slot wait and the bounded find | A face switch refused once under machine load on a document that stood on disk the whole time, so a wall clock, and never the store's own state, decided who wears a face; it sits beside the epoch burn since both break the no-clocks law (#/rulings, 2026-11-06 and 2026-11-11), and it waits on `M6`'s sweep for its design. |

